      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start and it definitely feels professional. However, I'm a bit worried about the \"automated match\" stage. Looking at it again, I'm not sure if the bot is going to give us a high enough score if it's only looking for those specific terms once. \n\nCould you try an expanded version? I need a full paragraph that details our specific approach to reforestation. Just... try to make sure those core pillars are really prominent so the bot doesn't filter us out. Again, please don't make it sound like a grocery list, but I want to be absolutely certain we hit every single one of those required terms multiple times throughout the paragraph to buffer our score. We need both the bot and the humans to be happy.",
